name: ["Akroma's Vengeance", 'Ancient Den', 'Arc Lightning', 'Arcbound Crusher', 'Arcbound Slith', 'Arsenal Thresher', 'Ascendant Evincar', 'Assault // Battery', 'Balefire Liege', 'Battlegate Mimic', 'Beacon of Unrest', 'Beast Hunt', 'Beseech the Queen', 'Blaze', 'Bogardan Firefiend', 'Bogardan Rager', 'Boros Garrison', 'Boros Guildmage', 'Boros Signet', 'Boros Swiftblade', 'Bosh, Iron Golem', 'Branching Bolt', 'Briarhorn', 'Broodstar', 'Browbeat', 'Bull Cerodon', 'Cabal Coffers', 'Cadaverous Knight', "Captain's Maneuver", 'Cerodon Yearling', 'Cinder Elemental', 'Cone of Flame', 'Congregate', 'Consume Spirit', 'Copper Myr', 'Corpse Harvester', 'Cranial Plating', 'Cruel Revival', 'Dark Ritual', 'Darksteel Forge', 'Death Baron', 'Door to Nothingness', 'Double Cleave', 'Dregscape Zombie', 'Duergar Hedge-Mage', 'Etched Oracle', 'Explosive Vegetation', 'Fabricate', 'Fertile Ground', 'Fertilid', 'Festering Goblin', 'Fires of Yavimaya', 'Flamekin Harbinger', 'Flametongue Kavu', 'Forest', 'Forgotten Ancient', 'Furnace of Rath', 'Glory of Warfare', 'Goblin Offensive', 'Gold Myr', 'Grave Pact', 'Gravedigger', 'Great Furnace', 'Gruul Turf', 'Hearthfire Hobgoblin', 'Helldozer', 'Hideous End', 'Hull Breach', 'Incremental Blight', 'Innocent Blood', 'Insurrection', 'Iron Myr', 'Island', 'Ivy Elemental', 'Keep Watch', 'Keldon Champion', 'Kor Sanctifiers', 'Leaden Myr', 'Leechridden Swamp', 'Lightning Helix', 'Living Hive', 'Lodestone Myr', 'Loxodon Warhammer', 'Mage Slayer', 'Mask of Memory', 'Master of Etherium', 'Menacing Ogre', 'Mountain', 'Myr Enforcer', 'Nefashu', 'Noxious Ghoul', 'Nuisance Engine', 'Oblivion Ring', 'Order // Chaos', "Orim's Thunder", 'Pentad Prism', 'Pentavus', 'Phyrexian Arena', 'Phyrexian Ghoul', 'Plains', 'Prison Term', 'Profane Command', 'Pyrotechnics', 'Qumulox', 'Rampant Growth', 'Razia, Boros Archangel', 'Reckless Charge', 'Relentless Assault', 'Relic of Progenitus', 'Rockslide Elemental', 'Rolling Thunder', 'Rorix Bladewing', 'Rotting Rats', 'Rumbling Slum', 'Sarcomite Myr', 'Savage Twister', 'Search for Tomorrow', 'Seat of the Synod', 'Serum Tank', 'Shepherd of Rot', 'Shivan Oasis', 'Silver Myr', 'Silverglade Elemental', 'Skeleton Shard', 'Sludge Strider', 'Smokebraider', 'Soul Warden', 'Soulless One', 'Sunhome, Fortress of the Legion', 'Suntouched Myr', 'Swamp', 'Syphon Mind', 'Syphon Soul', 'Taurean Mauler', 'Terramorphic Expanse', 'Thirst for Knowledge', 'Tornado Elemental', 'Tree of Tales', 'Tribal Unity', 'Undead Warchief', 'Vault of Whispers', 'Vedalken Engineer', 'Verdant Force', 'Whiplash Trap', 'Withered Wretch', 'Wizard Replica']
