text: ["({2/B} can be paid with any two mana or with {B}. This card's mana value is 6.)\\nSearch your library for a card with mana value less than or equal to the number of lands you control, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", '({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {B}.)\\nLeechridden Swamp enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{B}, {T}: Each opponent loses 1 life. Activate only if you control two or more black permanents.', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)', 'Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)\\nFlying', "Affinity for artifacts (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)\\nFlying\\nBroodstar's power and toughness are each equal to the number of artifacts you control.", 'Any player may have Browbeat deal 5 damage to them. If no one does, target player draws three cards.', 'Arc Lightning deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three targets.', 'Artifacts you control have indestructible. (Effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy them. Artifact creatures with indestructible can\'t be destroyed by damage.)', 'As Arsenal Thresher enters the battlefield, you may reveal any number of other artifact cards from your hand. Arsenal Thresher enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each card revealed this way.', "As long as it's your turn, creatures you control get +2/+0.\\nAs long as it's not your turn, creatures you control get +0/+2.", 'Assault deals 2 damage to any target.', 'At the beginning of each upkeep, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, Rumbling Slum deals 1 damage to each player.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'Blaze deals X damage to any target.', "Boros Garrison enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Boros Garrison enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {R}{W}.", 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nWhenever an opponent casts a spell, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Taurean Mauler.', 'Choose one or both —\\n• Branching Bolt deals 3 damage to target creature with flying.\\n• Branching Bolt deals 3 damage to target creature without flying.', 'Choose one —\\n• Destroy target artifact.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.\\n• Destroy target artifact and target enchantment.', "Choose two —\\n• Target player loses X life.\\n• Return target creature card with mana value X or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\n• Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn.\\n• Up to X target creatures gain fear until end of turn. (They can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Cone of Flame deals 1 damage to any target, 2 damage to another target, and 3 damage to a third target.', 'Create X 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Creatures of the creature type of your choice get +X/+X until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control have haste.\\nSacrifice Fires of Yavimaya: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Destroy all artifacts, creatures, and enchantments.\\nCycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Destroy target non-Zombie creature. It can't be regenerated. Return up to one target Zombie card from your graveyard to your hand.", 'Destroy target nonblack creature. Its controller loses 2 life.', 'Door to Nothingness enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{W}{W}{U}{U}{B}{B}{R}{R}{G}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Door to Nothingness: Target player loses the game.', 'Double strike', 'Draw a card for each attacking creature.', 'Draw three cards. Then discard two cards unless you discard an artifact card.', 'Each other player discards a card. You draw a card for each card discarded this way.', 'Each player sacrifices a creature.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.\\nWhenever a creature enters the battlefield under an opponent's control, you may attach Prison Term to that creature.", 'Enchant land\\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional one mana of any color.', 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0 for each artifact you control.\\n{B}{B}: Attach Cranial Plating to target creature you control.\\nEquip {1}', 'Equipped creature gets +3/+0 and has trample and lifelink.\\nEquip {3}', 'Exile target attacking creature.', 'Fertilid enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}{G}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Fertilid: Target player searches their library for a basic land card, puts it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffles.', 'First strike\\nWhenever another creature dies, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Rockslide Elemental.', 'Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking blocks this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)\\n{1}{B}{B}: Regenerate Cadaverous Knight.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nWhen Bogardan Rager enters the battlefield, target creature gets +4/+0 until end of turn.', "Flash\\nWhen Briarhorn enters the battlefield, target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.\\nEvoke {1}{G} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nOther black creatures get +1/+1.\\nNonblack creatures get -1/-1.", 'Flying, haste', 'Flying, vigilance, haste\\n{T}: The next 3 damage that would be dealt to target creature you control this turn is dealt to another target creature instead.', 'Flying\\n{U}, Sacrifice Wizard Replica: Counter target spell unless its controller pays {2}.', "Gruul Turf enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Gruul Turf enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {R}{G}.", 'Haste\\nEcho {2}{R}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\nWhen Keldon Champion enters the battlefield, it deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'If a source would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals double that damage to that permanent or player instead.', "If an opponent had two or more creatures enter the battlefield under their control this turn, you may pay {U} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nReturn two target creatures to their owners' hands.", 'Ivy Elemental enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.', "Kicker {R} (You may pay an additional {R} as you cast this spell.)\\nDestroy target artifact or enchantment. If this spell was kicked, it deals damage equal to that permanent's mana value to target creature.", 'Kicker {W} (You may pay an additional {W} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Kor Sanctifiers enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Lightning Helix deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life.', "Master of Etherium's power and toughness are each equal to the number of artifacts you control.\\nOther artifact creatures you control get +1/+1.", 'Other red creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther white creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever you cast a red spell, Balefire Liege deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker.\\nWhenever you cast a white spell, you gain 3 life.', 'Pentavus enters the battlefield with five +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Pentavus: Create a 1/1 colorless Pentavite artifact creature token with flying.\\n{1}, Sacrifice a Pentavite: Put a +1/+1 counter on Pentavus.', 'Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature, two -1/-1 counters on another target creature, and three -1/-1 counters on a third target creature.', "Put target artifact or creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. Shuffle Beacon of Unrest into its owner's library.", 'Pyrotechnics deals 4 damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', 'Reveal the top three cards of your library. Put all creature cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', 'Rolling Thunder deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Phyrexian Ghoul gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Savage Twister deals X damage to each creature.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.\\nSuspend 2—{G} (Rather than cast this card from your hand, you may pay {G} and exile it with two time counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter. When the last is removed, you may cast it without paying its mana cost.)', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for an artifact card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Shivan Oasis enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', 'Skeletons you control and other Zombies you control get +1/+1 and have deathtouch.', "Soulless One's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Zombies on the battlefield plus the number of Zombie cards in all graveyards.", 'Spend only black mana on X.\\nConsume Spirit deals X damage to any target and you gain X life.', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\n{1}, Remove four +1/+1 counters from Etched Oracle: Target player draws three cards.', 'Sunburst (This enters the battlefield with a charge counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)\\nRemove a charge counter from Pentad Prism: Add one mana of any color.', 'Syphon Soul deals 2 damage to each other player. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Target creature gains double strike until end of turn. (It deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', 'Target creature gets +3/+0 and gains haste until end of turn.\\nFlashback {2}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Target player gains 2 life for each creature on the battlefield.', 'The next X damage that would be dealt to target creature, planeswalker, or player this turn is dealt to another target creature, planeswalker, or player instead.', 'Trample, haste\\nWhen Menacing Ogre enters the battlefield, each player secretly chooses a number. Then those numbers are revealed. Each player with the highest number loses that much life. If you are one of those players, put two +1/+1 counters on Menacing Ogre.', 'Trample\\nTap an untapped artifact you control: Lodestone Myr gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Trample\\nWhenever Living Hive deals combat damage to a player, create that many 1/1 green Insect creature tokens.', 'Trample\\nWhenever another artifact enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on Arcbound Crusher.\\nModular 1 (This creature enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it. When it dies, you may put its +1/+1 counters on target artifact creature.)', "Trample\\n{3}{R}, Sacrifice an artifact: Bosh, Iron Golem deals damage equal to the sacrificed artifact's mana value to any target.", 'Unearth {B} ({B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'Untap all creatures and gain control of them until end of turn. They gain haste until end of turn.', 'Untap all creatures that attacked this turn. After this main phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase.', 'Vigilance, haste', 'When Bogardan Firefiend dies, it deals 2 damage to target creature.', 'When Duergar Hedge-Mage enters the battlefield, if you control two or more Mountains, you may destroy target artifact.\\nWhen Duergar Hedge-Mage enters the battlefield, if you control two or more Plains, you may destroy target enchantment.', 'When Festering Goblin dies, target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'When Flamekin Harbinger enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an Elemental card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.', 'When Flametongue Kavu enters the battlefield, it deals 4 damage to target creature.', 'When Gravedigger enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "When Oblivion Ring enters the battlefield, exile another target nonland permanent.\\nWhen Oblivion Ring leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'When Rotting Rats enters the battlefield, each player discards a card.\\nUnearth {1}{B} ({1}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'When Silverglade Elemental enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "When Tornado Elemental enters the battlefield, it deals 6 damage to each creature with flying.\\nYou may have Tornado Elemental assign its combat damage as though it weren't blocked.", 'Whenever Arcbound Slith deals combat damage to a player, put a +1/+1 counter on it.\\nModular 1 (This creature enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it. When it dies, you may put its +1/+1 counters on target artifact creature.)', 'Whenever Nefashu attacks, up to five target creatures each get -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Noxious Ghoul or another Zombie enters the battlefield, all non-Zombie creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Serum Tank or another artifact enters the battlefield, put a charge counter on Serum Tank.\\n{3}, {T}, Remove a charge counter from Serum Tank: Draw a card.', 'Whenever a creature you control dies, each other player sacrifices a creature.', 'Whenever a player casts a spell, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Forgotten Ancient.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may move any number of +1/+1 counters from Forgotten Ancient onto other creatures.', 'Whenever another artifact enters the battlefield under your control or another artifact you control leaves the battlefield, you may pay {1}. If you do, target player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.', "Whenever equipped creature attacks, it deals damage equal to its power to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.\\nEquip {3}", 'Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, you may draw two cards. If you do, discard a card.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', "Whenever you cast a spell that's both red and white, Battlegate Mimic has base power and toughness 4/2 until end of turn and gains first strike until end of turn.", 'Zombie spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nZombie creatures you control get +2/+1.', '{1}, {T}: Add {R}{W}.', '{1}: Exile target card from a graveyard.', '{1}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Search your library for a Zombie card and a Swamp card, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', '{1}{R}: Target creature gains haste until end of turn.\\n{1}{W}: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.', '{2}, {T}: Add {B} for each Swamp you control.', '{2}, {T}: Create a 0/1 colorless Pest artifact creature token.', '{2}: Sarcomite Myr gains flying until end of turn.\\n{2}, Sacrifice Sarcomite Myr: Draw a card.', '{3}, {T} or {B}, {T}: Return target artifact creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{B}{B}{B}, {T}: Destroy target land. If that land was nonbasic, untap Helldozer.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add two mana in any combination of colors. Spend this mana only to cast Elemental spells or activate abilities of Elementals.', '{T}: Add two mana of any one color. Spend this mana only to cast artifact spells or activate abilities of artifacts.', '{T}: Add {B}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}: Target creature gains double strike until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Add {R}.', '{T}: Add {U}.', '{T}: Add {W}.', '{T}: Each player loses 1 life for each Zombie on the battlefield.', '{T}: Target player exiles a card from their graveyard.\\n{1}, Exile Relic of Progenitus: Exile all graveyards. Draw a card.', '{X}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Cinder Elemental: It deals X damage to any target.']
flavor: ['"A horrible sight, yes, but the sounds . . . Its twanging tendons and grinding gears are almost musical."\\n—Brudiclad, Telchor engineer', '"A little dark magic won\'t stop me. The worse the curse, the better the prize."\\n—Radavi, Joraga relic hunter, last words', '"All memory of your existence will be wiped from reality. You will die, and no one will mourn."\\n—Memnarch', '"Be silent and listen to your inner fire. Only then can you walk the Path of Flame."', '"Crovax knows we\'re coming now," said a grinning Sisay. "I just sent the *Predator* crashing into his stronghold."', '"Did it have this shape upon Mirrodin\'s creation, or did some inconceivable force shape the unshapable?"\\n—Pontifex, elder researcher', '"Even the threat of power has power."\\n—Jeska, warrior adept', '"For dim-witted, thick-skulled genetic mutants, they have pretty good aim."\\n—Sisay, captain of the *Weatherlight*', '"Frozen, we watched the funnel pluck up three of the goats—pook! pook! pook!—before we ran for the wadi."\\n—*Travelogue of Najat*', '"Have you ever held a Boros signet? There\'s a weight to it that belies its size—a weight of strength and of pride."\\n—Agrus Kos', '"I see their moral dilemmas. I see their raw courage. I see their self-sacrifice. I see our victory."', '"If there is such a thing as too much power, I have not discovered it."\\n—Volrath', '"In the gathering there is strength for all who founder, renewal for all who languish, love for all who sing."\\n—*Song of All*, canto 642', '"Lightning lives in everything, in living flesh and growing things. It must be set free."\\n—Rakka Mar', '"Maybe they wanted to be on the winning side for once."\\n—Matoc, lavamancer', '"Mercy? Mercy is for the playground, not the battleground."', '"My priests swore loyalty to the Cabal not until death, but beyond it."\\n—Cabal Patriarch', '"One does not question the size or shape of the grains of sand in an hourglass. Nor do I question the temperament of the souls under my guidance."', '"Only a mind unfettered with the concerns of the flesh can see the world as it truly is."', '"Such rage," thought Vhati, gazing up at the thunderhead from the *Predator*. "It is Greven\'s mind manifest."', '"Surely we could tame something besides hurdas and pillarfield oxen!"\\n—Sheyda, Ondu gamekeeper', '"Surrender your soul to me."', '"The bonds of loyalty can tie one to the grave."\\n—Crovax, ascendant evincar', '"The next one who tells me to relax and curl up by a fire is dead."\\n—Mirri of the *Weatherlight*', '"The secret to invention is to see something in your mind, then find where it hides in the world."', '"Their hopes dashed on our shields! Their victory slashed by our swords!"', '"When in doubt, kill \'em twice."', '"When the wielder is strong enough, any sword will do."\\n—Kresh the Bloodbraided', '"Who says lightning never strikes twice?"\\n—Storm shaman', '"Why keep such trinkets? They only add weight to your travels."', 'A drop of humanity for a sea of power.', 'A vertical scream pierces the night air and echoes doom through the clouds.', 'All Auriok children know the tale, "Bolgri and the Long Day of Squashing."', 'Art is unknown to the vedalken—for them, all creations must serve a purpose.', 'As Glissa searches for the truth about Memnarch, Bosh searches to unearth the secrets of his past.', "As Phage drank their energy, a vague memory of Jeska stirred. Then she lost herself again in the joy of her victims' suffering.", 'As the fifth sun joins the other four, new abilities awaken in the creatures of Mirrodin.', "Deep within the Cabal's vault, the Mirari pulsed like a dead sun—and its darkness radiated across Otaria.", 'Elves believe the hydra-god Progenitus sleeps beneath Naya, feeding on forgotten magics.', "Even the clouds bend themselves to Memnarch's will, eager to swallow those who oppose him.", 'Few Cabal fighters fear death. They fear what follows it.', 'Fire never dies alone.', 'For the necromancer barons, killing and recruitment are one and the same.', 'Grieve for the soul in death dishonored.\\n—Shadow Guild saying', 'Her sword burns with such brightness that foes avert their eyes and arrows divert their paths.', "His soul snared by an angel's curse, Crovax twisted heroism into its purest shadow.", 'Hobgoblins are best left alone. They sharpen their farm implements far more than is necessary for their work in the fields.', "In its center is a single red ant, a queen that regulates the hive's movements.", 'In life, it was a fetid, disease-ridden thing. In death, not much changed.', "In the erupting heart of Bogardan, it's hard to tell hurtling volcanic rocks from pouncing volcanic beasts.", 'In the gardens of the centaurs, many travelers have mysteriously vanished while admiring the elaborate topiaries.', 'In the smoldering ashes of Shiv, a few dragons strive to rebuild their native land. The rest seek any opportunity to restore the broken pride of their race.', 'Ish Sah, den of the warlord Geth, commander of countless nim.', 'It has the strength of seven men. In fact, it used to be seven men.', 'It holds motionless vigil, watching Naya in silence through the screen of the whitecover. When it senses anything amiss, it launches forward with the uncanny sound of torn fog.', 'It responds with unnatural precision.', 'Its blood is life. Its body is growth.', 'Ixidor had only to imagine their ruin and Akroma made it so.', 'Kamahl left the violence of his former life behind him, but he still believes in the power of muscle.', 'Kuldotha, wellspring of molten metal, temple of the goblin horde.', 'Left to itself, nature overflows any container, overthrows any restriction, and overreaches any boundary.', 'Lumengrid, site of the Knowledge Pool, source of vedalken arcana.', 'Lymph, the fluid essence of blinkmoths, is prized by wizards for the rush of intellect it provides.', 'Metal permeates the marrow of every bone in Mephidross—except one.', "Mimics don't need perfect disguises. They need only the perfect victims: the naive, the young, or the poor of sight.", 'Most myr monitor other species. Some myr monitor other myr.', 'Nature grows solutions to its problems.', "Oddly, no one questioned the Cabal's wisdom in hiring a zombie to work at the cemetery.", 'On Jund, even the landscape is a deadly hunter. Volcanoes, tar pits, and rock slides seem to prey upon the living.', 'Once it consecrated the dead. Now it desecrates them.', 'Only the hardiest explorers survive to eat the fruit.', 'Phyrexia wastes nothing. Its food chain is a spiraling cycle.', 'Plague and death wrapped in one convenient package.', "Rainclouds don't last long in Shiv, but that doesn't stop the lightning.", "Shadowmoor's main crops are rot, slime, and despair.", 'Sisay discovered that the mirrored hull of the *Weatherlight* could be used as a defensive weapon.', 'Sometimes you go to hell, and sometimes hell comes to you.', 'Sunhome—the stalwart shield, the towering sentinel, the seat of justice.', 'Taj-Nar, throne of Raksha Golden Cub, destined leader of the leonin prides.', "Tel-Jilad, sanctum of the ancient trolls, keepers of the secret of Mirrodin's origin.", 'The Moriok saw the myr as fellow scavengers, never knowing just who the myr were scavenging for.', 'The Orzhov contract the Izzet to animate slum districts and banish them to the wastes. The Gruul adopt them and send them back to the city for vengeance.', 'The elves thought of the myr as minor threats, just as the myr thought of the elves.', 'The furnace awaits the next master who would stoke the fires of apocalypse.', "The goblins didn't think of the myr at all, which allowed the myr to observe everywhere unhindered.", 'The leonin thought of the myr as omens, never imagining the sinister fate they foretold.', 'The power of a waterfall. The fury of an avalanche. The intellect of a gale-force wind.', 'The undead of Grixis are fueled by their hatred of the living.', 'The unit of measurement used to chart a cerodon\'s growth is "persons consumed."', 'The vedalken saw the myr as toys, unaware of the intelligence lurking behind their empty eyes.', 'Their rage can grow to such proportions that they explode in a cloud of fire.', 'They certainly are.', 'Those who hear her go mad with inspiration.', "Though less well-known than its army of soldiers, the Boros Legion's mage-priests are as respected by the innocent as they are hated by the ghosts of the guilty.", 'Torching Krosa would be pointless. It grows faster than it burns.', 'Underneath the cities of Esper are cycles of life unseen by those who feed them.', 'When necessary, myr can override and control any artificial object, as can their creator.', "When tempers run high, it's easy to lose your head.", 'When the Boros Legion attacks, swiftblades enter the fray first. They pick off the archers and mages, softening the enemy front before the flame-kin and giants go in.', 'Where the nefashu pass, blood rolls like a silk carpet.', 'Zombies mourn for the living and celebrate those who will soon be given the gift of death.']
artist: ['Adam Rex', 'Alan Pollack', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Andrew Goldhawk', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Ben Thompson', 'Bob Eggleton', 'Brandon Kitkouski', 'Brian Snõddy', 'Brom', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chippy', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Chuck Lukacs', 'Clint Langley', 'Corey D. Macourek', 'Craig Mullins', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Allsop', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Martin', 'Dermot Power', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Dominick Domingo', 'Don Hazeltine', 'Donato Giancola', 'Doug Chaffee', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Fred Rahmqvist', 'Glen Angus', 'Greg Hildebrandt', 'Greg Hildebrandt & Tim Hildebrandt', 'Greg Staples', 'Jason Chan', 'Jean-Sébastien Rossbach', 'Jeff Easley', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'John Avon', 'John Matson', 'Joshua Hagler', 'Justin Sweet', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Larry MacDougall', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Luca Zontini', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Michael Bruinsma', 'Michael Sutfin', 'Nils Hamm', 'Paolo Parente', 'Pete Venters', 'Puddnhead', 'Ralph Horsley', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Richard Thomas', 'Richard Wright', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ron Spears', 'Ron Spencer', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Stephan Martiniere', 'Stephen Tappin', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Tim Hildebrandt', 'Val Mayerik', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Wayne England', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
